---
description: Signed-in users must not be sent back to the marketing landing via logo/home links.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Signed-in logo / home

Once a user is signed in, do **not** send them to the marketing landing (`/`).

- Header **logo** and brand name → `/search` (job search), not `/`
- In-app “Home” / “Back to home” for signed-in users → `/search`
- Guests (logged out) can still use `/` for the landing page

Use `brand_home_url` (or equivalent) instead of hardcoding `href="/"`.
